   					&amp;lt;field&amp;gt;
   						&amp;lt;name&amp;gt;read_sequence_number&amp;lt;/name&amp;gt;
   						&amp;lt;description&amp;gt;Indicates the sequence number of the next descriptor for the read host to operate on. If the transfer mode is Streaming to Memory-Mapped, this field output is 0. This field is applicable only when Extended Feature Support parameter is enabled.&amp;lt;/description&amp;gt;
